keep ID communityID province city householdID inw2 r2agey ragender raeducl r2shlta hh2itot h2hhres r2work r2retemp r2hibpe r2diabe r2cancre r2lunge r2hearte r2stroke r2asthmae r2mstat r2whappyl r2cesd10 r2satlife r2smoken r2drinkn_c r2vgactx_c r2mdactx_c r2itearn hh2ctot r2ser7 r2orient r2imrc r2dlrc
gen wave2=2 if inw2==1
drop if wave2==.
tab wave2,m
