keep ID communityID province city householdID inw3 r3agey ragender raeducl r3shlta hh3itot h3hhres r3work r3retemp r3hibpe r3diabe r3cancre r3lunge r3hearte r3stroke r3asthmae r3mstat r3whappyl r3cesd10 r3satlife r3smoken r3drinkn_c r3vgactx_c r3mdactx_c r3itearn hh3ctot r3ser7 r3orient r3imrc r3dlrc
